26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-11-27T07:26:39Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T18:51:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113224","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113224","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113224.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113224.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This is a port of @lawnjelly's work on the \"Vital Updates Only\" Editor Setting feature. Looking through some older issues I saw several comments from @Calinou suggesting this port could resolve the issues and was desired.\r\n\r\nReplaces Editor Setting \"Update Continuously\" with new Enum, \"Update Priority\", add adds \"Vital_Only\" option, which stops many in-editor redraw_requests.\r\n\r\nResolves:\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/39758\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/76734\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10042\r\n\r\nImplements:\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/942\r\n\r\nPorts:\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/53463\r\n\r\nCurrently missing from this port: The Editor Caret Blink settings.\r\n\r\nPort is currently as direct as possible, but I'd be interested in any feedback on how this feature could be made more effective, or fit better into the 4.x ecosystem. \r\n\r\nTo test, create a new project, and create a frequently updating node, such as a Particle Spawner. Go to Editor Settings, and change \"Update Priority\" from it's default Update_When_Changed to Update_Vital_Only, and you should see the scene redraw much less frequently, if not freeze entirely.\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:* Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/39758 Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/76734 Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10042 Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/942","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113224/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113224/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}